			'settings.playerGuideEntryRtxSuperResolutionBody' => 'Settings → Player kernel → Super resolution: efficiency or quality. Windows desktop GPUs only; upscales low-res sources on high-DPI screens.',
			'settings.playerGuideEntryDanmakuLoadTitle' => 'Cutting danmaku load',
			'settings.playerGuideEntryDanmakuLoadBody' => 'In Settings → Danmaku style, lower the font size, speed or opacity, or hide the flying layer, to cut load on weak devices.',
			'settings.playerGuideEntryHwdecCodecsTitle' => '--hwdec-codecs',
			'settings.playerGuideEntryHwdecCodecsBody' => 'Which codecs hardware-decode. Defaults to all; if a codec glitches, narrow the range to one that excludes it (software fallback).',
